    "simple_explanation": "'\u0939\u092e\u093e\u0930\u0947 \u092f\u0947 \u0915\u0932\u093e\u092e\u0902\u0926\u093f\u0930' is studied by first understanding the main idea, then noticing the evidence, examples and relationships in the chapter.",
